{"reviews":[{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-0","r":5.0,"t":"PLEASE KEEP THIS WONDERFUL COMPACT ALIVE","x":"My favorite compact makeup for years. I occasionally say a prayer that Revlon won't discontinue this in my lifetime. Don't you hate when that happens?","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2015"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-1","r":4.0,"t":"When applied it looked nice and has good coverage and reduces shine","x":"When applied it looked nice and has good coverage and reduces shine. Over a few hours though, it did become visible and crackled looking, especial in areas of the face move a lot. This may also be due to my oily skin.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-2","r":5.0,"t":"Stays put!","x":"Color Stay is perfect for me.  One time application in the morning and it stays put.  It's my favorite brand for powder foundation and mascara. It blends well with concealer and doesn't look like liquid foundation can look when someone put it on a little too heavily.  I can't see it when I'm done.  I don't like to look like I have makeup on.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-3","r":5.0,"t":"Stays put!","x":"Color Stay is perfect for me.  One time application in the morning and it stays put.  It's my favorite brand for powder foundation and mascara. It blends well with concealer and doesn't look like liquid foundation can look when someone put it on a little too heavily.  I can't see it when I'm done.  I don't like to look like I have makeup on.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-4","r":4.0,"t":"My everyday face powder I use!","x":"I like it on my 54 year old face but I can\u2019t erase my lines!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-5","r":4.0,"t":"Best powder I've used that stays on all day","x":"Best powder I've used that stays on all day, takes care of shine, and also downplays redness in my face.  Cheaper on Amazon than at Target.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-6","r":4.0,"t":"I like it a lot","x":"I like it a lot. I prefer the Photoready pouder of Revlon though, cause I think it covers imperfections better, but this works pretty well","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-7","r":1.0,"t":"Producto entregado en mal estado","x":"[[VIDEOID:dccbdafbbc4d1942739fee48cedd75a8]] El producto est\u00e1 roto, regado el polvo y el empaque est\u00e1 pegado con cinta","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-8","r":4.0,"t":"Tested it smooth, silkie, light weight.","x":"I love Relovn products. It's just that I haven't just the powder yet because I picture was lighter than the product. IT was the perfect shade online but when I received it, the powder was much darker than my skin tone. So, I can't comment on the product persay yet not until I order the proper shade. Thank you for your interest.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great worh any foundation!","x":"This is my go to powder for any of my foundations that I try on. It lasts for the whole day without any touch ups. I don't use a lot just enough to cover the face with a small amount to make it last the whole day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-10","r":4.0,"t":"works well - goes on easy","x":"I like the product.  I can't say it is any better than any of the other products that are similar.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-11","r":4.0,"t":"Four Stars","x":"Among the best drugstore powders on the market and Amazon's prices is unbeatable.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-12","r":5.0,"t":"Covers great. Doesn't clog pores","x":"Covers great.  Doesn't clog pores. Works great on my sensitive skin!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-13","r":5.0,"t":"Decent product","x":"good coverage, lots of shades to choose from","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-14","r":5.0,"t":"Long time user of this makeup.","x":"I have been buying these Revlon compacts for years and have always enjoyed the smooth coverage they give my skin.  I use no other makeup.  Usually there is a lower compartment that has a mirror and the powder puff in it...but while it looked the same, this time I could not get that compartment open, so I am using an old puff.  I have always preferred that they leave the mirror out and give me more powder, but while I don't know if the mirror is still there or not, the amount of powder remained t","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-15","r":2.0,"t":"Weird color","x":"The product has good coverage. And goes on smooth, but the color is weird. When you first apply it, the color looks fine, but when you start blending it in, it takes on a weird gray hue. It's very strange. I applied it with the sponge it came with and on a bare face. I'm going to see if a different applicator makes a difference, and if not I'll try a different color, and then update.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-16","r":5.0,"t":"Mis polvos de toda la vida","x":"Ya no recuerdo la cantidad de a\u00f1os que llevo usando estos polvos y la verdad es que lo compro sin reparar en nada, se me ha convertido en mi indispensable de siempre, tengo la piel mixta y este producto es ideal para matizar mis brillos, lo uso en compa\u00f1\u00eda de la base ColorStay en el tono toast.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-17","r":5.0,"t":"Repeat customer","x":"This is my 'go to' pancake makeup.  I have used this for years and will continue to do so. Good coverage without being \"thick\" or \"cake-y\".  Price here on Amazon similar to all other places so the ease of ordering it and having it delivered is a plus.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-18","r":3.0,"t":"Ivory Too Light.","x":"I like that it seems to be oil free but the Ivory was too light, even for me. It's not translucent, it's more of a White color. But I still will use it. My favorite brand stopped offering Ivory and only carry dark shades. I'll keep searching.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-19","r":5.0,"t":"BEST Drugstore Pressed Powder!","x":"As a professional Aesthetician, I LOVE this powder! GREAT coverage at an AMAZING price! Is is MAC, no. But is it full coverage with decent ingredients at a ridiculously affordable price? YESSSS!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-20","r":4.0,"t":"Better color for Asian complexion.","x":"The color is the closest that I've ever found for Asian complexion.  Most foundations for fair/medium skin are predominantly pink, so having the addition of a shade of ochre is welcome.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-21","r":5.0,"t":"\u2714\ufe0f\u2714\ufe0f\u2714\ufe0f","x":"Fits my skin tone, arrives on time, reliable scheduled delivery. Have used more high end products over 25 years... no allergies, problems using this powder, recommend!!!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2023"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-22","r":5.0,"t":"Make up fresh 16 hours!","x":"I have oily skin helps to not see too much of it and ive been using this powder for 27 years and its always been 5 stars with me Thank you Revlon your the best!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great Makeup","x":"My favorite compact. I have sensitive skin and this product has never bother me. it goes on light and smooth. Great price and comparable to high end compacts.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B0C52PWCV2-24","r":1.0,"t":"Color too light","x":"Color is WAY to light and makes me look very pale. Sad I wasted my money and won\u2019t be able to use this product as the weight and matte shine are very nice.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the powder for staying put and lasting all day with minimal touch-ups.","cites":[3,4,6,10]},{"text":"Many customers highlight good coverage and shine control, including on sensitive skin.","cites":[2,6,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers are long-time, loyal users who consider it a favorite or go-to powder.","cites":[1,3,4,10,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note drawbacks like cracking/creasing over time or difficulty opening the compact.","cites":[2,5,15]},{"text":"Some mention shade or condition issues, such as receiving a darker shade or a broken product.","cites":[8,9]}]},"qa":[]}